Package: termux-train
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: termux-learn-crypto <vilasrmeshram400@gmail.com>
Depends: python, pytorch-termux, transformers-termux, scikit-learn-termux, soundfile-termux, librosa-termux, matplotlib-termux, ffmpeg
Recommends: termux-api
Section: python
Priority: optional
Description: Train your own small AI models on your phone
 Train on your own data, then use the model offline:
  train-gpt (tiny GPT from your text), train-chat (teach SmolLM2-135M
  your Q&A with LoRA), train-classifier (spam/mood/category from CSV),
  voice-record + train-voice (recognise your own sounds/words).
 Use: my-ai list/chat/ask/gen/predict/voice/plot. Samples: my-ai init.
